    "m_Title": "",
    "m_Content": "Lerp works here like a conditional.\nT value changes the output.\n\nT is the interpolation between a and b.\n\n if T= 0, white. if T = 1, grey.\nIn my case, isRaining true? cloud is grey otherwise its white.\n\n ",
